{"authored" [{"question" "q-74410" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int (1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "c120718f931743c0d70fc46b9969277639e5f9861a4347dee3126eaccbdfe717" "basis" 1134 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74410" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "c120718f931743c0d70fc46b9969277639e5f9861a4347dee3126eaccbdfe717" "basis" 1134 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74410" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4630758fe7518876b4078da53f63d140afc115ff54e30376f6c8b26fc3d8c081" "basis" 1134 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74410" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "c120718f931743c0d70fc46b9