on" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74410" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/state.json" "file_sha256" "c120718f931743c0d70fc46b9969277639e5f9861a4347dee3126eaccbdfe717" "basis" 1134 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008673/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x={cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{4}{|}_{0}^{\\pi /24} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{24})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(\\frac{1}{2}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "88c7e401f34dfd71b5bb0b70383af45dc65df5093ef61537bec281612c77ddad" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{4}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{8}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{2}{3}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{3}{8}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "f9b645c0bde798708f6f4b88004b39a15ab5cefeffe5ab9dbf6e494c31c1c035" "basis" 1715 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74408" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n$\\int (5-8{cos}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069587/state.json" "file_sha256" "5efee3b433b1f9c9ed2c9a846412c153cccb5159d00616f305a9fdbebceee41d" "basis" 2383 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069587/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74408" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta $ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡2x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5-8{cos}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x & =\\int [5-8\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1)]\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int [5-4(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1)]\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (1-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x-4(\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)+C \\\\  & =x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069587/state.json" "file_sha256" "5efee3b433b1f9c9ed2c9a846412c153cccb5159d00616f305a9fdbebceee41d" "basis" 2383 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069587/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74408" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069587/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3f0ef1e2cc5820a983fe85f1772d8da0b532517